    BarChart(
        data = data,
        modifier = Modifier.fillMaxSize()
    )
}
```

And in your `MainActivity` or another Composable function, call the `ExampleBarChart()` function to display the chart.

```kotlin
setContent {
    MaterialTheme {
        ExampleBarChart()
